@ECHO OFF
PATH A:\DOS
PROMPT $P$G
VER
ECHO.
ECHO This is the ARM-DOS 4.00 Startup diskette.
ECHO.
ECHO To start over with an empty hard disk, the way a new PC came from the shop:
ECHO   FORMAT C: /S     erases everything on drive C: and makes it bootable
ECHO                    (it asks for C:'s current volume label: ARM-DOS)
ECHO   INSTALL          copies DOS from this diskette to C:\DOS
ECHO Then take the diskette out and press Ctrl+Alt+Del.
ECHO.
ECHO Changed your mind later? "Reset C: to factory" on the page brings the
ECHO original drive C: back, games and all.
ECHO.
